Song.prompt:
Production animation asset for Seoul Hero, transparent RGBA cutout atlas, ONE character Song Jinwoo from the reference. Preserve black tousled hair, teal hooded jacket, dark undershirt, black cargo trousers and sneakers, 3.5-head chibi proportion, clean detailed hand-painted cel-shaded modern Korean fantasy game look. NO scooter, NO vehicle, NO weapon. This is NOT a walking-frame sprite sheet. Make separately painted overlapping articulated body pieces with hidden joint portions filled in.

Very strict layout: a regular 8-column x 3-row grid, equal cells, wide landscape canvas. Leave at least 15% empty transparent margin inside EACH cell, no pieces touching adjacent cells, no text, labels or borders. Every row depicts ONE consistent viewing direction from a slightly elevated 2D arena camera:
ROW 1 = facing camera/down, symmetrical front view.
ROW 2 = facing screen right, full right side profile.
ROW 3 = facing away/up, rear view with NO face on back.
Within EACH row exactly these 8 separated parts left to right:
1 head including complete hair and neck;
2 torso jacket chest with full shoulders and waist, no head and no arms;
3 pelvis/short upper trouser hips with belt, no legs;
4 one upper arm jacket sleeve, vertically down with rounded shoulder and elbow overlap;
5 one forearm plus gloved hand, vertically down with full elbow overlap;
6 one trouser thigh, vertically down with rounded hip and knee overlap;
7 one lower trouser shin, vertically down with full knee and ankle overlap;
8 one sneaker shoe, ankle overlap at top.

Draw only one of each limb; engine duplicates it for the other side. Similar limb geometry across rows. Arms and legs relaxed straight for rigging. Foot pointing towards camera in front, screen right in side, away in back. Original skin/hair/clothing style, not pixel art, not realistic human photography, not generic flat vector shapes. White/light highlights restrained, no baked ground shadow, no glow cloud. Pieces are complete painted objects with smooth alpha edges, not sawed-out fragments. Use the full requested large landscape resolution for sharp texture detail.

